        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk1-numbers-r5-04-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Half a quantity and whole-yuan prices",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "半 precedes a compatible measure. Whole-yuan prices use 元 or conversational 块 directly after the number; do not add 个 before money units.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我看半本书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ kàn bàn běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "I read half a book.",
                "audio": "a426bfc29f66002248f4ae935591dbc2a426cd385cac4113be806914af5c97f3"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书五元。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū wǔ yuán 。",
                "meaning": "This book costs five yuan.",
                "audio": "db595129671f0ae2bad2438b2574629eb253c9f6a35e1cc84cfa413ea1651b4a"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书五块钱。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū wǔ kuài qián 。",
                "meaning": "This book costs five yuan, conversationally.",
                "audio": "5c1402f713d39b49aff110bad49540d6e58bb7b7e298ea88a824806ab0a38837"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
